This repository contains portions adapted from third-party projects:

1. action-atlas (https://github.com/CWRU-AISM/action-atlas)
   License: Apache License 2.0
   - pilotvla/pi05_adapter.py adapts the Pi05 model adapter (model loading and
     the lerobot pre/post-processor pipeline) and the video-saving helper.
   - pilotvla/libero_utils.py and pilotvla/metrics.py adapt LIBERO environment and
     evaluation helpers originally written for that project's experiment
     suite.

2. lerobot (https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot)
   License: Apache License 2.0
   - The steering-aware sampler in pilotvla/rollout_swap.py
     (install_guided_sampler) replicates the PI05 sample_actions integration
     loop from lerobot's modeling code, with steering terms added.

